<Doc title="Support" description="Help for Simple Fest, the spreadsheet ticket scanner for event teams.">
  <p>Need help with Simple Fest? Email <a href="mailto:contact@digitalshiftou.com?subject=Simple%20Fest%20support">contact@digitalshiftou.com</a> and we will reply within two business days.</p>

  <h2>Getting started</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Tap <strong>Import guest list</strong> and pick a CSV or Excel file, or paste a Google Sheet link shared as "Anyone with the link can view".</li>
    <li>Check the detected scan modes (entrance, day passes, meals, drinks) in the Event tab.</li>
    <li>Choose a scan mode and tap <strong>Scan</strong>, or type a ticket code.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Using several phones</h2>
  <p>On the main phone open <strong>Devices</strong> and tap <strong>Host</strong>. On the other phones choose <strong>Join another device</strong> and scan the invite QR. Scans keep working offline and sync when the connection returns.</p>

  <h2>Exporting results</h2>
  <p>Open <strong>Event</strong> and tap <strong>Export scans as CSV</strong> to share the updated guest list with every scan time.</p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Doc>
